{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"ron","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"RON","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for RON (.ron).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"ron","name":"RON","extensions":[".ron"],"grammar":"grammars/ron.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"RON","path":"snippets/ron.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/ron.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#!\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z_][\\\\w]*(?=\\\\s*[({])\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z_][\\\\w]*(?=\\\\s*:)\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|None|Some)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/ron.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:Name}(\",\n      \"    ${2:field}: ${3:value},\",\n      \")\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct value\"\n  },\n  \"Enable extension\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"enable\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#![enable(${1:implicit_some})]\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An extension\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# RON\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for RON.\n\n## Files\n\n`.ron`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 2 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `struct` | A struct value |\n| `enable` | An extension |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}